# Files that run inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings, also when the
# repo is checked out on Windows (CRLF breaks shell scripts and config files).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
